  4. Suggested fix order

  1. S1 and S2 (XSS):
     - Build tooltip labels as an HTMLElement with textContent.
     - Turn on interpolation.escapeValue: true, or sanitize the notification HTML with DOMPurify.
  2. S5: append frame-ancestors to the existing CSP instead of replacing it, and drop it on /base/*. This puts the CSP back as a second line of defence.
  3. S3 and S4:
     - Allow only http(s) plugin URLs and add sandbox to the iframe.
     - Intersect the share projection and filter with the visible fields, and strip columnMeta from share responses.
  4. S7 and S9: remove cookie and authorization before sending errors to Sentry, and fail startup when default secrets are in use in production.
  5. B1, B2 and B4 (chat panel):
     - Add key={baseId} on the table page, or reset state when baseId changes.
     - Abort the stream and disable the selector when switching agent.
     - Fix the Enter-while-streaming guard.
  6. S8: decide whether 2FA should cover social logins, or label it "password sign-in only".
  7. Clean-up: delete the unused ai-elements and components/ui, delete the committed .claude-flow files and update .gitignore, fix the lint error, and raise the timeout on the 2 flaky tests.

  I haven't changed any code. I saved a short summary of these findings t